WEBVTT

00:00:00.401 --> 00:00:08.369
In this video, you will change the name and description of your entry, and then see how to take your home out of a contest, if you ever need to.

00:00:08.369 --> 00:00:09.468
We start on the map.

00:00:10.371 --> 00:00:14.433
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:16.558
That is the only address you need.

00:00:18.656 --> 00:00:21.062
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:24.806
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:24.806 --> 00:00:26.144
Tap Use my location.

00:00:27.897 --> 00:00:32.334
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:35.539
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:35.539 --> 00:00:40.099
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:43.973 --> 00:00:46.663
Now look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:46.663 --> 00:00:47.858
See the three dots?

00:00:47.858 --> 00:00:52.161
That is the menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:52.161 --> 00:00:52.699
Tap them.

00:00:54.308 --> 00:00:55.946
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:55.946 --> 00:01:01.284
That is where every neighborhood contest lives: the ones you can vote in, enter, or run.

00:01:02.988 --> 00:01:03.603
Tap Mine.

00:01:03.603 --> 00:01:08.342
Under Homes you entered, you will find your entry, and the contest it is in.

00:01:08.342 --> 00:01:09.388
Tap Open contest.

00:01:11.085 --> 00:01:12.429
Tap Open contest.

00:01:14.538 --> 00:01:16.365
Find the card called Your home.

00:01:16.365 --> 00:01:18.478
This is where you manage your entry.

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:20.191
Tap Edit name and description.

00:01:21.888 --> 00:01:25.455
Change the name, or add a better description, then tap Save.

00:01:25.455 --> 00:01:28.438
You can do this any time while the contest is open.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:34.130
If you ever need to take your home out of the contest, tap Withdraw.

00:01:35.815 --> 00:01:39.268
It asks you to tap again, so you cannot do it by accident.

00:01:39.268 --> 00:01:42.428
Once you do, your home leaves the contest and the map.

00:01:44.375 --> 00:01:45.890
Next up: Your profile.
